 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add v1 `FilesService.AddFile`, which uploads a file from a name and reader
+  and builds the multipart/form-data body internally. Item association is
+  supported through `WithFilesDealID`, `WithFilesPersonID`,
+  `WithFilesOrganizationID`, `WithFilesProductID`, `WithFilesActivityID`,
+  `WithFilesLeadID` and `WithFilesProjectID`.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- Raw client requests with streaming bodies (for example uploads read from
+  files opened with `os.Open`) are now retried on 429 and 502/503/504. Such
+  bodies are materialized before the request is sent, so the request gains a
+  working `GetBody` and a known `Content-Length` instead of chunked transfer.
+  Request bodies are buffered in memory for this.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
